<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-Clariant upped at JP Morgan. [CORRECTED 16:55 GMT]</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Clariant upped at JP Morgan. [CORRECTED 16:55 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss speciality chemicals group Clariant AG was raised to &quot;buy&quot; from &quot;market performer&quot; at JP Morgan, the investment bank said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Analysts at JP Morgan said they expected Clariant to generate &quot;powerful&quot; earnings growth through the next three years, propelled by the weakness of the Swiss franc, high volume growth and restructuring measures.</p>
<p>JP Morgan set an end-1998 price target of 1,170 francs (corrects from 1,720 francs) on the stock.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
</text>
